#: C/basics-open-file.page:9
msgid "Open a file"
msgstr "Opne ei fil"

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/basics-open-file.page:13
msgid ""
"To open a file in GNOME Text Editor use <gui style=\"button\">Open</gui> in "
"the Headerbar and <gui>Open New Document</gui> or the shortcut "
"<keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>O</key></keyseq>."
msgstr ""
"For å opne ei fil i GNOME Tekstredig much brukar du <gui "
"style=\"button\">Opne</gui> i topplinja og <gui>Opne nytt dokument</gui> "
"eller snarvegen <keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>O</key></keyseq>."

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/basics-open-file.page:17
msgid ""
"In the dialog choose your file(s) you want to open and click <gui>Open</"
"gui>. It is possible to select multiple files to open these at once."
msgstr ""
"I vindauget vel du fil(ene) du vil opne og klikkar <gui>Opne</gui>. Det er "
"mogleg å velje fleire filer for å opne desse samtidig."

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/basics-open-file.page:20
msgid ""
"Closing the dialog without opening a file can be achieved by clicking "
"<gui>Cancel</gui>."
msgstr ""
"Å lukke vindauget utan å opne ei fil kan gjerast ved å klikke "
"<gui>Avbryt</gui>."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: C/basics-open-file.page:23
msgid "Open by name"
msgstr "Opne etter namn"

#. (itstool) path: section/p
#: C/basics-open-file.page:25
msgid ""
"You can search in the <gui>Open</gui> Popup or press <keyseq><key>Ctrl</"
"key><key>K</key></keyseq> to search for recently edited files."
msgstr ""
"Du kan søkje i <gui>Opne</gui> eller trykkje "
"<keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>K</key></keyseq> for å søkje etter nyleg "
"redigerte filer."

